{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-128",
  "title": "Next Challenge Considerations",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Next Challenge Considerations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "to maximize your shot at securing funding from **the next challenge**, you need a razor-sharp application that **proves impact, traction, and scalability**. since it's a **journalism + media innovation** competition, docket needs to be framed not just as a **tool for tv scheduling**, but as a **platform that enables community-driven journalism & local storytelling**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5 Key Things to Nail Before Applying**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Sharpen Your Core Narrative** (Why Docket Matters for Journalism)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**the judges need to see docket as more than a tv guide cms.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "frame it as **a public access media enabler** that empowers local journalism, civic engagement, and community voices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**pitch angle:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"local news is dying. public access tv is underfunded & outdated. docket is rebuilding the infrastructure that lets independent creators, civic organizations, and hyperlocal journalists distribute content, engage audiences, and keep their communities informed—without needing massive budgets or technical expertise.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**tie it to journalism's struggles:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "declining local news coverage"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "fragmentation of public interest media"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "lack of tools for small broadcasters & independent journalists"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "need for platforms that empower local voices"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **action:** rewrite your core pitch deck & application answers to position docket as an **essential tool for local journalism & civic engagement**—not just a scheduling system."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Secure Stronger Early Traction (Beyond Speak MPLS)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "you already have **a great validation partner in speak mpls**, but the judges will want to see that docket has broader demand."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**priorities before march:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ onboard **at least 2-3 more public access stations or civic media groups** as early adopters"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ get **at least one government or nonprofit org** interested in white-labeling docket for public engagement"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ collect **strong testimonials & data points**—even a quote like *\"this saved us 10 hours/week\"* makes a difference"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **action:** identify 10-20 potential partners (public stations, indie newsrooms, media nonprofits) and fast-track pilots."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Define Your MVP Scope (What’s Ready in 6-12 Months?)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "funders want to see **a clear, achievable roadmap**. they’re not investing in an idea—they’re investing in **a product they believe can scale**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **what’s already built?** → highlight what’s working now."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **what’s launching in the next 6 months?** → set clear development milestones."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **what’s the big vision (2-3 years)?** → show long-term potential without looking unrealistic."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**example roadmap for the application:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**q2 2024:** expand beta testing with 5+ stations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**q3 2024:** release self-serve onboarding + automated cablecast integration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**q4 2024:** launch full white-label support for gov & nonprofit partners"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**2025+:** scale docket as a **community-driven syndication platform**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **action:** refine your product roadmap so it looks **realistic, impactful, and fundable**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Strengthen Business Model & Sustainability Plan**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**judges will ask: how does this sustain itself?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "will it be grant-funded long-term?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "does it generate sustainable revenue?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "what’s the path to scaling?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "right now, your **saas model ($49-$199/month)** is solid but **public access stations are budget-sensitive**. make sure your **pricing strategy + funding model** can address this."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ways to strengthen the pitch:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ clarify pricing tiers & what each unlocks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ highlight **potential institutional partnerships** (e.g., city govs, media nonprofits)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ outline **grant + sponsorship potential** (ex: state/local media funding, public media foundations)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ show **long-term sustainability** → revenue + potential funding sources beyond grants"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **action:** finalize a clear financial model that balances **subscription revenue, partnerships, and grants**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Tighten Your Go-to-Market Strategy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "having a great product isn’t enough—you need **a scalable plan to get it into the hands of users**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "before applying, refine how you’ll:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ acquire early customers (direct outreach, partnerships, content marketing)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ make onboarding seamless (self-serve setup, automated integrations)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ leverage advocacy groups (acm, media nonprofits, public broadcasting networks)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **action:** prepare a **1-2 page go-to-market strategy** that details **how you’ll reach 100+ stations & beyond**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**final checklist before applying**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **strong core pitch** → why docket **matters for local journalism**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **early traction** → get 2-3 more public access stations on board"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **clear product roadmap** → what’s launching in the next 6-12 months"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **sustainable business model** → how you’ll make money & scale"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **solid go-to-market plan** → how you’re getting this into the right hands"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if you tighten up these areas before march, **docket will be a serious contender**. judges will see it as **a scalable, impactful, and fundable solution for community-driven media**—which is exactly what they’re looking for."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}